      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON FEMME (8) was in the placings last time but prior to that she clocked an excellent 19.57 win over 352m at Q Lakeside. Hard to top on the time from two back. WISHING STAR (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Best Summer (30.06) in a Grade 6. Took the lead and boxed on but run over. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Bold showing expected. ROYAL GHOST (1) scored a most impressive win two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 9 length 4th at this track (30.70). Expected to run well. HIGH LEAK (3) won as favourite last time and is in the mix again.",
